<title>UK: Birmingham Intl Airport year profits take off.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Intl Airport year profits take off.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birmingham International Airport Ltd reported a 13 percent take-off in annual pretax profits on Thursday to 13.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Turnover was up five percent to 60.2 million at the UK's fifth largest airport.</p>
<p>Ireland's Aer Rianta said it is in negotiations to take a controlling stake in Birmingham airport through a joint venture with NatWest Ventures but talks have not been completed.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
